## Change
One can now specify tool provider for an AI Service. This provider will be called each time AI service is called and will decide which tools should be specified in the request to the LLM.

Example:
```java
Assistant assistant = AiServices.builder(Assistant.class)
    .chatLanguageModel(model)
    .toolProvider(request -> {
        if (request.userMessage().singleText().contains("booking")) {
            ToolSpecification bookingToolSpecification = ToolSpecification.builder()
                .name("get_booking_details")
                .description("Returns booking details")
                .addParameter("bookingNumber", type("string"))
                .build();
                
            return ToolProviderResult.builder()
                .add(bookingToolSpecification, new BookingToolExecutor())
                .build();
        } else {
            return null;
        }
    })
    .build();
```

